ss=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZakRulz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1507333-favorite-movie-genres?p=1516713#post1516713\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don\u2019t remember much of it other than it getting weird when a second Crow was introduced.</div> </div> </div> </div>The 1990's had lots of weird tv shows like that with Buffy, Angel, Charmed, Dark Angel, Kindred The Embraced, Time Trax and many others.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-30T10:56:31-07:00","id":1516808,"title":"","content":"Kindred: The Embraced was great.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-02T05:46:55-07:00","id":1516964,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZakRulz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1507333-favorite-movie-genres?p=1516636#post1516636\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The one with Edward Furlong was definitely B-Movie/Grindhouse cheesy but it was fun.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> <br /> It's been a looong time since I've watched it, but I just remember it being awful. Maybe I need to revisit.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1507333-favorite-movie-genres?p=1516660#post1516660\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I totally forgot about the short lived tv series about Crow.</div> </div> </div> </div>I haven't watched in a while, but I remember it fondly! I'm a bit of a Crow fanatic, so I was super into it that show. I'm still bummed it only went the one season and left us completely hanging.<br /> \u200b<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZakRulz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1507333-favorite-movie-genres?p=1516713#post1516713\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don\u2019t remember much of it other than it getting weird when a second Crow was introduced.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh yea! I remember thinking that was pretty cool! And the idea of Snakes, essentially the evil version of a Crow. That show was pretty crazy, but in a way I liked. LOL.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> And just to say, I loved Kindred The Embraced!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-02T11:25:02-07:00","id":1516985,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1507333-favorite-movie-genres?p=1516964#post1516964\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200b<br /> <br /> It's been a looong time since I've watched it, but I just remember it being awful. Maybe I need to revisit.<br /> <br /> \u2026</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh it was awful in a cheesy B-Movie way. Like 0 on rotten tomatoes bad.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-03T06:03:20-07:00","id":1517057,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZakRulz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1507333-favorite-movie-genres?p=1516985#post1516985\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh it was awful in a cheesy B-Movie way. Like 0 on rotten tomatoes bad.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am not surprised!! LOL<br /> <br /> I want to say it's based on one of the novels, and I believe the novel was waaaay better. But, it's been a while since I've thought about it. I'll have to give it another watch sometime. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affil